      "cooked": "<p>I introduced the game to my oldest brother and some of his friends last Saturday, and we made a rule so that if you called a player by his name instead of his hero, you had to take a drink. We didn't really experiment with other rules, but you could also have rules such as taking a drink whenever one of your hero takes damage or whenever your equipment or ongoings are destroyed take a drink for each one destroyed.</p>",
