      "created_at": "2013-04-09T10:10:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes! &nbsp;My housemates and I we discussing this. &nbsp;We're students (read:alcoholics) and were going to play it. &nbsp;\"Shot whenever you take damage\" and \"waterfall throughout the Argent's turn\" were proposed and lead to giggles over how very messy, how very quickly it would get.</p><p>Alas, we were too scared of spillages ruining our cards.</p>",
