      "id": 59226,
      "name": "Benhimself",
      "username": "Benhimself",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/benhimself/{size}/2160_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-09T11:12:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cameo: Whenever a character whose card is in play appears on the artwork of a card played from another deck, everyone takes a drink. (Mostly stuff like Heros and Villains, but sometimes you'll get cases like Macbre Spectre on Throat Jab or whatnot)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Waste Not: Whenever you don't use a power, OR don't play a card, but not when you skip both for the extra card, take a drink.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:34:57.857Z",
